<section id="integration" class="card" aria-labelledby="integration-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="integration-heading">Fits the rest of church life</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Because roster, events, and finance share one database, you can run <a href="/features/automation/">custom reports</a> like volunteer hours by ministry or giving summaries by family — without stitching CSVs from three apps. And because everything is team-scoped, a youth minister only sees their group’s events and messages.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Similar size-and-shape orgs: <a href="/use-cases/nonprofits/">nonprofits</a>, <a href="/use-cases/youth-clubs/">youth clubs</a>, <a href="/use-cases/sports-leagues/">sports leagues</a>, <a href="/use-cases/first-robotics/">FIRST teams</a> (also volunteer-led, season-driven).</p>
  </div>
</section>

