<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Church FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can small-group leaders manage their own roster?</h3>
    <p>Yes — assign managers to a team and they can manage their group’s members, events, and announcements without broader access. <a href="/features/members/">Member roles</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can we track donations and expenses here?</h3>
    <p>Yes. The ledger lives next to the roster, with tags and receipt uploads. Stripe handles online giving today; Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo are on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>. <a href="/features/finance/">Finance →</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Is GatherPack appropriate for a small congregation?</h3>
    <p>Yes — flexible enough for a 10-person club or a 500-person org. Start with roster and events; add finance and reporting as you grow. <a href="/features/">Feature hub</a></p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

